#. type: Title =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/module2.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Module 2: Modelling collections"
msgstr "模組 2：館藏品的模型建立"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/module2.adoc:8
msgid "This module aims to give an overview of the GRSciColl data model. Participants will learn what information can be shared on GRSciColl and how to model it."
msgstr "本模組旨在概述 GRSciColl 資料模型。學員將了解哪些資訊可在 GRSciColl 上共享，以及如何建立模型。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/module2.adoc:12
msgid "Explain the types of entries within GRSciColl."
msgstr "說明 GRSciColl 中的條目類型。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/module2.adoc:13
msgid "Explain collection descriptors and how to capture information using the descriptors."
msgstr "說明「收藏描述」，以及如何利用這些描述來擷取資訊。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/module2.adoc:14
msgid "Explain how occurrences are linked to institution and collections within GRSciColl."
msgstr "說明在 GRSciColl 系統中，出現紀錄資料是如何與機構及館藏建立關聯的。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/module2.adoc:15
msgid "Model a set of new entries in GRSciColl."
msgstr "在 GRSciColl 中建模一組新條目。"

